{"comments":[{"body":"Triage + plan (agent). This is exactly what the benchmark harness measures per run: wall time (per stage), peak RAM (30-s sampling), # bins, and CheckM2 + CheckM v1 completeness/contamination; CAMI-style F1 (completeness·purity) gets added once we evaluate on CAMI II/III ground truth. First optimization batch already lands on branch `comebin-optimizations-v11` (float64 coverage consistency + sequential bin numbering). 'Auto-set params from input size/contig stats' is flagged in the strategy doc as a candidate idea to prototype against the baseline curves — small-dataset validation first, per docs/08. Full criterion set + decision gate: docs/09-optimization-strategy.md (linked in README).","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:56:21Z","id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWd-qUg"}],"state":"OPEN","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T20:56:21Z"}
