{"comments":[{"body":"Delivered: optimization strategy + decision flowchart committed to `main` (f8dd2e4) in docs/09-optimization-strategy.md and linked from the README. Flow: candidate change → small functional test → benchmark on small/medium → gate on time AND quality (keep commit and continue, or revert/rework and combine with other surviving ideas) → large benchmark only after major commits. Metrics table includes runtime, peak RAM, bins, CheckM2/CheckM v1 means, CAMI-style F1. I'll keep the doc current per batch and mirror results in docs/03-fixes.md + results/.","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:56:22Z","id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWd-raw"},{"body":"Closed by automation — addressed: Verified complete — optimization decision flowchart, commit-selection gates, metrics, and README link are committed in f8dd2e4; issue comment 5802797931 records delivery.","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:57:42Z","id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWd_z0w"}],"state":"CLOSED","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T20:57:42Z"}
