    fix(batch1): sequential bin numbering + keep float coverage depth
    
    - gen_bins (filter_small_bins.py + scripts/gen_bins_from_tsv.py): bin files
      are now numbered sequentially per bin (0,1,2,...). Previously bin_name
      incremented inside the per-contig loop, so bin IDs equalled the cumulative
      contig count and a cluster whose first contig was missing left an empty
      stray file. Sequence lookup via dict.get() instead of try/except.
    - data_aug/gen_cov.py + data_aug/gen_var.py: keep fractional per-base depth
      (float) instead of truncating to int, preserving coverage precision.

