 list. I will prepare, per dataset, a package with PROVENANCE (origin, filters, preparation commands), md5 checksums, sizes, and a deposit-ready JSON, and document the exact upload steps in the repo. Ready now: the small 94 MB dataset (300 contigs). Later: medium 3,000-contig set, COMEBin demo inputs, and CAMI II marine sample-0 inputs — each packaged after its run. Sandbox (sandbox.zenodo.org) is recommended for a dry run first. Can you create the token, or prefer manual upload?","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:56:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5802798274","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWeAjgw","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Addendum: the preservation workflow is now committed in c65969a. `docs/10-data-preservation.md` documents the release scope, licensing/provenance prerequisites, and DOI verification; `scripts/make_release_manifest.py` streams SHA-256/size manifests. A local manifest for the 94 MB `comebin_small` set is staged and structurally verified (manifest SHA-256 `cb734384f7c069a8667d1a044ada3cb84d496321c9052e2212423e9a30fbf135`). No Zenodo upload is claimed; the token/manual-deposit approval and metadata choices from the previous comment are still required.","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:58:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5802828675","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWkfxOw","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Received ✅ — the Zenodo API token is verified and working against production Zenodo:\n\n- `GET /api/deposit/depositions` → 200 (account access confirmed)\n- `POST` empty deposition → 201 (write/deposit permissions confirmed), throwaway deposition 22933060 created and immediately deleted → 204, nothing left behind.\n\nThe token is kept only in a local secret file (mode 0600, outside the repository) and will never be written to the repository, commits, logs, or this issue.\n\nReady to proceed with the actual deposit. `comebin_small` (94 MB) is packaged with a verified manifest (`cb734384f7c069a8667d1a044ada3cb84d496321c9052e2212423e9a30fbf135`). Still needed from you (per my earlier comment) before uploading: (1) title, (2) description/abstract, (3) license (e.g. CC BY 4.0), and (4) creator list with ORCIDs where available. Once provided, I will create the deposition, upload the archive + public manifest/provenance, publish, verify the DOI, and link the record from `docs/01-datasets.md` / README as planned in `docs/10-data-preservation.md`. A `sandbox.zenodo.org` dry run first is optional — say the word.","createdAt":"2026-09-24T07:18:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5809631547","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"number":8,"title":"Add benchmark data to zenodo","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T07:18:51Z","url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8"}
