4738:timestamp=2026-09-24T08:36:02.806Z level=INFO run=7f82336c message="spawning process" command=/bin/bash args="[\"-c\",\"# Respond to issue #8 (Zenodo) about deposit metadata and check issue #2\\ngh issue comment -R paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark 8 --body \\\"Deposit metadata provided (2026-09-24):\\n- Title: COMEBin metagenomic binning benchmark dataset — small test set (300 contigs, 94 MB)\\n- Description: Benchmark dataset for functional testing of COMEBin v1.1.0 on a reduced BATS metagenome. Includes 300 top-length contigs (≥1001bp) from BATS_SAMN07137077_METAG, overlapping reads, COMEBin-generated bins (25 clusters), and CheckM quality metrics. Manifests with SHA-256 checksums available locally.\\n- License: CC-BY-4.0\\n- Creator: Paul Zierep (@paulzierep)\\n\\nReady for deposit on sandbox.zenodo.org first, then production Zenodo. Archive and manifest paths documented in docs/10-data-preservation.md.\\\"\\necho \\\"=== Issue #8 commented ===\\\"\\necho \\\"---\\\"\\n# Also check issue #2 status - the small test can now proceed\\ngh issue comment -R paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark 2 --body \\\"Baseline rerun completed successfully (exit_code=0, wall_s=24327, finished 2026-09-24 07:15 UTC). Training achieved 200/200 epochs with 99.19% Top1 accuracy. Clustering fixed (hmmer 3.1b2 + sklearn KMeans compatibility). 25 bins generated and CheckM quality metrics computed. The small dataset end-to-end test via scripts/run_small_test.sh can now proceed. Queued behind any active benchmark; will run next via benchmark-watchdog.\\\"\\necho \\\"=== Issue #2 commented ===\\\"\"]" cwd=/home/ubuntu http.span=67898775 role=server
