CommitDate: Thu Sep 24 08:36:20 2026 +0000

    fix: remove n_jobs from KMeans for sklearn >=1.0 compatibility
    
    sklearn 1.1.3 removed the n_jobs parameter from KMeans.__init__.
    Also fix imports to use public sklearn API instead of private
    sklearn.cluster._kmeans module.
    
    Fixes clustering failure (Seed_num: 0) that prevented binning.

